irus with genetic alterations: Want to be faster? More offensive? More resilient? The choice is yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2>25+ bosses based on real-world microscopic organisms.<br><br>Challenging boss battles with a strong focus on dodging and stamina management.<br><br>Extra game modes (Endless Roguelite, Arcade).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059420/extras/13dfef8da21ef4d8ade89acfdfd1056e.poster.avif?t=1759176351\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059420/extras/13dfef8da21ef4d8ade89acfdfd1056e.webm?t=1759176351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059420/extras/13dfef8da21ef4d8ade89acfdfd1056e.mp4?t=1759176351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Exclusive soundtrack for each boss, energetic, with fusions of drum and bass and various other electronic music genres.<br><br>Multiple equipment options for head (your shots), legs (your dash), and body (passive abilities) that deeply alter the way you play.<br><br>15+ mini-virus allies with various functions for your battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059420/extras/1e6efb4e04c2898572979df1b1a94f88.poster.avif?t=1759176351\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059420/extras/1e6efb4e04c2898572979df1b1a94f88.webm?t=1759176351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059420/extras/1e6efb4e04c2898572979df1b1a94f88.mp4?t=1759176351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Get ready to dive into this microscopic adventure, but be careful not to be e